Package: farr
Title: Data and Code for Empirical Research in Accounting
Version: 1.1.1
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Ian",
           family = "Gow",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "iandgow@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6243-8409"))
Description: Data sets and functions for empirical accounting research,
    including event-return calculations, panel-data simulations, classification
    performance measures, and 'Parquet' file workflows using 'DuckDB'. Supports
    methods described in "Empirical Research in Accounting: Tools and Methods"
    (2024) <doi:10.1201/9781003456230>. The online companion is
    available at <https://iangow.github.io/far_book/>.
